{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Lan Mo's Flower","Ordinary girl Lan Mo once got a headdress flower which could transform her into a dream girl. She use this image to chase her childhood sweetheart, Liu Yi Feng. The story happens between them is sweet and touching."],"ja":["蓝漠的花",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-36185","ids":{"shikimori":36185,"mal":36185,"anilist":99858,"kodik":"serial-38142"},"kodikIds":["serial-79140","serial-38142"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-79140":"2026-10-18T17:16:12Z","serial-38142":"2021-12-27T08:32:44Z"},"title":"Цветок Мо Лань","originalTitle":"Lan Mo`s Flower","alt":"Lan Mo De Hua","description":"Мо Лань — обыкновенная, ничем не примечательная пятнадцатилетняя девушка, любящая фаст-фуд и имеющая мальчишеские повадки. Она влюблена в лучшего друга, Лю Ифэна, однако не может раскрыть ему свои чувства. Однажды девушка купила волшебное украшение для волос в виде цветка, с помощью которого может превращаться в красавицу. Приняв прекрасный облик, Мо Лань пытается узнать, как же Лю Ифэн относится к ней на самом деле.","year":2017,"type":"ONA","genres":["Романтика","Школа"],"rating":6.41,"popularity":0,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/36185/68f5af4b1eb7bc91d180d7492bbb6bf7.jpeg","width":355,"height":525},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/99858-BMc6Arkh2EtU.jpg","width":1500,"height":500}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6,7,8,9],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-4242","dubId":"4242","label":"LifeAnime","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-79140","translationId":"4242","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1679943/42ecf0840671f62c2e15ac8e8cf5b090/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-1968","dubId":"1968","label":"Light